{"version":2,"slug":"learn-english-while-making-mistakes-slow-english-podcast","videoId":"C_bygkBeaYc","videoUrl":"https://youtu.be/C_bygkBeaYc","lang":"en","title":"Learn English while MAKING MISTAKES | Slow English Podcast","category":"Daily life","channel":"Miss Honey 🍯","channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/@Slow_English_Podcast","captionSource":"auto","tags":["English Conversation","learn english"],"backUrl":"/","lines":[{"start":0,"text":"You can't learn a language"},{"start":3,"text":"while constantly protecting [music]"},{"start":6,"text":"yourself from"},{"start":9,"text":"mistakes."},{"start":10,"text":"What if"},{"start":12,"text":"the reason you're afraid"},{"start":15,"text":"[music]"},{"start":15.6,"text":"to speak English"},{"start":17,"text":"has nothing to do"},{"start":19,"text":"[music]"},{"start":19.6,"text":"with your level"},{"start":21,"text":"of English?"},{"start":29,"text":"Welcome back to my slow English podcast."},{"start":33,"text":"Learn English with conversations."},{"start":38,"text":"I love having conversations with you"},{"start":41,"text":"guys."},{"start":42,"text":"And today"},{"start":43,"text":"I have a topic that's very interesting"},{"start":47,"text":"to me."},{"start":49,"text":"It's a little more complicated to"},{"start":51,"text":"understand."},{"start":52,"text":"So, I'm going to leave this episode at"},{"start":56,"text":"level B2 to C1. I've been reading"},{"start":61,"text":"The Untethered Soul"},{"start":64,"text":"and it's made me realize something. We"},{"start":67,"text":"spend so much of our lives"},{"start":71,"text":"closing"},{"start":73,"text":"ourselves off"},{"start":75,"text":"from"},{"start":77,"text":"uncomfortable"},{"start":78,"text":"feelings."},{"start":79,"text":"And I think we do the exact same thing"},{"start":84,"text":"when it comes to learning a language."},{"start":88,"text":"But this episode"},{"start":90,"text":"isn't just about learning English. It's"},{"start":94,"text":"about being open"},{"start":97,"text":"to life"},{"start":98,"text":"and what happens"},{"start":101,"text":"when we start to close ourselves from"},{"start":105,"text":"it."},{"start":106,"text":"So,"},{"start":107,"text":"let's talk about opening our hearts to"},{"start":112,"text":"the world"},{"start":113,"text":"and what it might look like to stop"},{"start":117,"text":"closing them."},{"start":119,"text":"It's like when you meet someone"},{"start":122,"text":"and you connect deeply with them."},{"start":126,"text":"Whether that's a romantic connection or"},{"start":131,"text":"a friendship"},{"start":132,"text":"but being around or close to that person"},{"start":137,"text":"gives you so much energy."},{"start":141,"text":"We've all felt that, right?"},{"start":144,"text":"That energy isn't coming from the food"},{"start":148,"text":"that you eat"},{"start":149,"text":"or the sleep that you get"},{"start":153,"text":"but"},{"start":154,"text":"it's still there."},{"start":156,"text":"You can feel it."},{"start":158,"text":"You're excited."},{"start":160,"text":"You're inspired."},{"start":162,"text":"You want to talk."},{"start":165,"text":"You want to go places."},{"start":168,"text":"And everything just feels more alive."},{"start":172,"text":"And"},{"start":174,"text":"according to this book"},{"start":176,"text":"that energy always exists inside of you."},{"start":181,"text":"Always."},{"start":183,"text":"It's just a matter of opening your heart"},{"start":187,"text":"to it."},{"start":189,"text":"The book"},{"start":190,"text":"gives a real-life example"},{"start":192,"text":"of what it looks like when you open your"},{"start":196,"text":"heart to something"},{"start":198,"text":"or what it feels like when your heart is"},{"start":202,"text":"open."},{"start":203,"text":"Like being around a friend"},{"start":206,"text":"that gives you so much energy."},{"start":209,"text":"But maybe that same friend"},{"start":212,"text":"does something"},{"start":214,"text":"that makes you feel betrayed"},{"start":217,"text":"or hurt."},{"start":218,"text":"Maybe they say something that hurts your"},{"start":222,"text":"feelings."},{"start":224,"text":"Maybe they don't invite you somewhere."},{"start":228,"text":"And in that instant, you can almost feel"},{"start":232,"text":"your heart"},{"start":233,"text":"closing up."},{"start":235,"text":"And that energy that was flowing"},{"start":239,"text":"just stops flowing the way it used to."},{"start":243,"text":"Maybe you become quieter."},{"start":247,"text":"Maybe you pull away."},{"start":250,"text":"Maybe you decide,"},{"start":253,"text":"\"I'm not going to let anyone make me"},{"start":256,"text":"feel this way again.\""},{"start":259,"text":"You close your heart to protect yourself"},{"start":263,"text":"from those feelings of betrayal and"},{"start":267,"text":"hurt. And your body has learned"},{"start":270,"text":"throughout the years"},{"start":272,"text":"to close off"},{"start":275,"text":"to protect itself from those feelings of"},{"start":278,"text":"pain. And this is where I started"},{"start":282,"text":"thinking about English. Because I think"},{"start":287,"text":"we can experience something very similar"},{"start":291,"text":"when it comes to learning a new"},{"start":294,"text":"language. Maybe you were speaking"},{"start":297,"text":"English one day"},{"start":299,"text":"and someone corrected you in a way that"},{"start":303,"text":"made you feel embarrassed."},{"start":306,"text":"Maybe you tried to say something"},{"start":309,"text":"but the words just wouldn't come out."},{"start":313,"text":"Maybe someone just didn't understand"},{"start":316,"text":"your accent."},{"start":318,"text":"Nothing terrible happened,"},{"start":322,"text":"but you remember how it made you feel."},{"start":327,"text":"We never forget how something made us"},{"start":332,"text":"feel."},{"start":333,"text":"And suddenly,"},{"start":335,"text":"out of nowhere,"},{"start":337,"text":"you start protecting yourself"},{"start":340,"text":"from feeling that way"},{"start":343,"text":"again."},{"start":344,"text":"You speak less."},{"start":347,"text":"You use easier words"},{"start":350,"text":"instead of challenging yourself."},{"start":353,"text":"You think about every sentence before"},{"start":357,"text":"saying it."},{"start":359,"text":"Maybe you even start telling yourself,"},{"start":364,"text":"\"I'm just shy speaking English.\""},{"start":367,"text":"And maybe you are shy."},{"start":370,"text":"But"},{"start":372,"text":"maybe part of that shyness"},{"start":376,"text":"is just protection."},{"start":379,"text":"Maybe you've learned to close yourself"},{"start":382,"text":"off because you don't want to feel"},{"start":386,"text":"embarrassed again."},{"start":388,"text":"And I think"},{"start":390,"text":"it's very interesting"},{"start":393,"text":"because we do this"},{"start":395,"text":"in many areas of our lives."},{"start":399,"text":"We experience pain,"},{"start":402,"text":"rejection,"},{"start":403,"text":"embarrassment,"},{"start":406,"text":"criticism,"},{"start":407,"text":"and then"},{"start":409,"text":"we create rules"},{"start":411,"text":"to never have to experience those"},{"start":415,"text":"feelings again."},{"start":417,"text":"If you're liking this video, be sure to"},{"start":419,"text":"like it so it will reach more English"},{"start":422,"text":"learners."},{"start":423,"text":"And subscribe to have conversations like"},{"start":426,"text":"this with me every week."},{"start":429,"text":"Now,"},{"start":430,"text":"going back to that example"},{"start":434,"text":"of the friend who"},{"start":436,"text":"makes you feel hurt,"},{"start":438,"text":"maybe that friend"},{"start":441,"text":"apologizes."},{"start":444,"text":"And then"},{"start":445,"text":"suddenly you feel your heart open"},{"start":449,"text":"in an instant."},{"start":451,"text":"You feel that same energy"},{"start":455,"text":"you felt at the beginning"},{"start":458,"text":"flowing again."},{"start":460,"text":"And nothing outside of you, physically"},{"start":463,"text":"gave you that energy back."},{"start":466,"text":"But,"},{"start":468,"text":"the situation changed."},{"start":471,"text":"And you opened your heart again."},{"start":474,"text":"You allowed yourself to open again."},{"start":479,"text":"When you close your heart center,"},{"start":482,"text":"that energy can't flow in the same way."},{"start":487,"text":"And when you open,"},{"start":489,"text":"all that energy rushes up inside of you"},{"start":492,"text":"again. And one of the ideas from this"},{"start":495,"text":"book that really stuck with me is that"},{"start":499,"text":"closing your heart doesn't necessarily"},{"start":503,"text":"protect you."},{"start":506,"text":"It just locks you in."},{"start":509,"text":"And that is the part that I think"},{"start":512,"text":"applies"},{"start":514,"text":"so beautifully"},{"start":516,"text":"in learning a language. Because,"},{"start":520,"text":"when you stop yourself from speaking"},{"start":524,"text":"because you're scared of making a"},{"start":527,"text":"mistake. Yes,"},{"start":530,"text":"maybe you protect yourself from feeling"},{"start":533,"text":"embarrassed"},{"start":535,"text":"for a few seconds, but"},{"start":539,"text":"you also miss the conversation."},{"start":543,"text":"You miss the correction that could have"},{"start":546,"text":"taught you something new."},{"start":549,"text":"You miss the opportunity to realize,"},{"start":553,"text":"\"Wait,"},{"start":554,"text":"I can do this.\""},{"start":557,"text":"The same wall that's protecting you from"},{"start":562,"text":"embarrassment"},{"start":564,"text":"is also the wall"},{"start":566,"text":"that's keeping you from growing."},{"start":570,"text":"And not just in English. Take a moment"},{"start":575,"text":"to think"},{"start":576,"text":"about where else you might be doing this"},{"start":581,"text":"in your life. Another idea from the book"},{"start":586,"text":"is that we put conditions"},{"start":589,"text":"on when we allow ourselves to be open."},{"start":594,"text":"I'll be happy"},{"start":595,"text":"if this happens."},{"start":598,"text":"I'll relax when this is over."},{"start":603,"text":"I'll speak when my English is better."},{"start":607,"text":"I'll be confident when my pronunciation"},{"start":611,"text":"improves."},{"start":612,"text":"I'll have conversations"},{"start":614,"text":"when I stop making so many mistakes."},{"start":619,"text":"But,"},{"start":621,"text":"if you think about it, you're waiting to"},{"start":624,"text":"be confident"},{"start":626,"text":"before doing the things that will build"},{"start":630,"text":"that confidence."},{"start":633,"text":"I do it all the time."},{"start":635,"text":"With language and with other things in"},{"start":639,"text":"my life. I have to force myself"},{"start":643,"text":"into uncomfortable situations,"},{"start":646,"text":"always."},{"start":648,"text":"For the rest of my life,"},{"start":651,"text":"I'm going to have to continue"},{"start":654,"text":"challenging myself more and more."},{"start":658,"text":"And you can only do that by being open."},{"start":663,"text":"So,"},{"start":664,"text":"what if you stayed open anyway?"},{"start":668,"text":"I encourage you"},{"start":671,"text":"to pay attention to the moments in your"},{"start":675,"text":"life"},{"start":676,"text":"when you feel"},{"start":678,"text":"love"},{"start":679,"text":"or"},{"start":681,"text":"enthusiasm"},{"start":682,"text":"because that's when your heart"},{"start":686,"text":"is open."},{"start":688,"text":"And then ask yourself,"},{"start":691,"text":"\"Why can't I feel this all the time?"},{"start":695,"text":"What changes?"},{"start":697,"text":"You feel love"},{"start":699,"text":"until someone says something you don't"},{"start":703,"text":"like. You feel excited to be at work"},{"start":708,"text":"until someone criticizes something that"},{"start":712,"text":"you did."},{"start":714,"text":"You feel confident speaking English"},{"start":717,"text":"until someone corrects you."},{"start":721,"text":"Someone hurting you"},{"start":723,"text":"doesn't have to make you stop loving."},{"start":727,"text":"One embarrassing conversation"},{"start":731,"text":"doesn't have to make you stop speaking."},{"start":735,"text":"You get to decide"},{"start":737,"text":"what closes you."},{"start":740,"text":"But even if you decide to close, why"},{"start":744,"text":"close?"},{"start":746,"text":"If you can continue feeling love and"},{"start":749,"text":"enthusiasm."},{"start":751,"text":"Staying open"},{"start":753,"text":"means letting yourself experience"},{"start":756,"text":"something, and staying open doesn't mean"},{"start":759,"text":"having no boundaries or limits."},{"start":763,"text":"It means experiencing something"},{"start":767,"text":"without letting that experience"},{"start":770,"text":"shut you out"},{"start":772,"text":"to everything that comes after it."},{"start":775,"text":"Define your own limits and enjoy all"},{"start":780,"text":"of life."},{"start":782,"text":"The more you open,"},{"start":784,"text":"the more energy you build."},{"start":787,"text":"Until at one point,"},{"start":790,"text":"that energy starts flowing out of you."},{"start":795,"text":"And it lights up a room that you're in."},{"start":799,"text":"You become a beam of light"},{"start":802,"text":"for your friends and family."},{"start":805,"text":"And I think that our emotional state can"},{"start":810,"text":"affect our physical state as well."},{"start":813,"text":"At least I've noticed that same"},{"start":816,"text":"connection in myself."},{"start":819,"text":"Um it mostly reflects"},{"start":822,"text":"in my skin."},{"start":825,"text":"My acne."},{"start":826,"text":"My acne is very sensitive. And when I'm"},{"start":832,"text":"not doing well,"},{"start":835,"text":"I often notice the changes in my skin."},{"start":840,"text":"Of course, there are a lot of things"},{"start":843,"text":"that affect how my skin looks, but there"},{"start":847,"text":"have been periods in my life"},{"start":850,"text":"where I've eaten"},{"start":853,"text":"terribly."},{"start":854,"text":"So much sugar,"},{"start":856,"text":"oil,"},{"start":857,"text":"lactose,"},{"start":859,"text":"basically everything that normally"},{"start":862,"text":"relates"},{"start":864,"text":"to my skin worsening."},{"start":867,"text":"But somehow"},{"start":869,"text":"I had incredible skin. But"},{"start":873,"text":"during that same period of my life,"},{"start":878,"text":"I also was in a very good place."},{"start":882,"text":"Surrounded by very positive people"},{"start":886,"text":"who built me up and poured their energy"},{"start":891,"text":"into me."},{"start":893,"text":"It's made me pay attention to how"},{"start":896,"text":"connected my mind and my body can be."},{"start":900,"text":"So let life be fun."},{"start":903,"text":"Get inspired."},{"start":906,"text":"Let yourself experience things fully."},{"start":910,"text":"Have the conversation."},{"start":912,"text":"Say things imperfectly."},{"start":915,"text":"Love people."},{"start":917,"text":"Even though loving people always comes"},{"start":921,"text":"with"},{"start":922,"text":"a risk. Let every minute of every day"},{"start":928,"text":"have the possibility"},{"start":930,"text":"of becoming an exciting experience. Not"},{"start":935,"text":"necessarily because it's an exciting"},{"start":938,"text":"experience, but because you're willing"},{"start":943,"text":"to stay open"},{"start":945,"text":"to experience it. There's a quote from"},{"start":948,"text":"The Untethered Soul that I love."},{"start":952,"text":"If you love life, then nothing is ever"},{"start":956,"text":"worth closing over."},{"start":958,"text":"So, that's what I want you to take from"},{"start":962,"text":"today's conversation. Pay attention to"},{"start":965,"text":"the moments where you close and ask"},{"start":969,"text":"yourself, \"What am I protecting myself"},{"start":972,"text":"from right now?\" And is that protection"},{"start":976,"text":"helping me?"},{"start":978,"text":"Or is it keeping me from experiencing"},{"start":982,"text":"life?"},{"start":983,"text":"And when it comes to English, remember"},{"start":988,"text":"fluency requires"},{"start":991,"text":"openness."},{"start":993,"text":"You cannot learn a language"},{"start":996,"text":"by constantly protecting yourself from"},{"start":999,"text":"making mistakes. So, stay open,"},{"start":1003,"text":"keep speaking,"},{"start":1005,"text":"and allow yourself to be a learner."},{"start":1010,"text":"Remember, guys, never stop learning."},{"start":1014,"text":"And if you like this video, then like it"},{"start":1017,"text":"so that it gets to more [music] English"},{"start":1019,"text":"learners. And subscribe to learn English"},{"start":1022,"text":"with me every week with videos [music]"},{"start":1025,"text":"like these. Bye."}]}